1
00:00:24,680 --> 00:00:28,160
Officer Nakagawa, no misses.
Score, perfect score.

2
00:00:31,160 --> 00:00:34,645
Nakagawa-san,

3
00:00:34,695 --> 00:00:41,060
That's wonderful.

4
00:00:41,320 --> 00:00:45,040
I could barely hit the target,
but you're truly amazing.

5
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:48,520
Well done, Nakagawa.
As your superior, I'm proud of you.

6
00:00:48,700 --> 00:00:50,900
Now we can go on the overseas
training trip together.

7
00:00:51,140 --> 00:00:51,540
Yes.

8
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:54,300
This concludes the men's division.

9
00:00:54,300 --> 00:00:55,480
Wait a minute!

10
00:00:56,020 --> 00:00:57,240
Get out of the way.

11
00:00:57,240 --> 00:00:58,920
Ryo-san

12
00:00:58,920 --> 00:01:01,000
What are you doing here?

13
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:03,200
Chief, that's not fair!

14
00:01:03,200 --> 00:01:07,280
Why didn't you tell me I had
the right to a marksman's title?

15
00:01:07,280 --> 00:01:11,800
There's no point telling someone who's been
skipping shooting practice for ten years.

16
00:01:11,800 --> 00:01:13,140
What are you talking about?

17
00:01:13,140 --> 00:01:16,220
The winner and runner-up get to
go on the overseas training trip.

18
00:01:16,220 --> 00:01:18,360
I heard there's a great score, right?

19
00:01:18,360 --> 00:01:21,900
Do you actually think you can
go on the overseas training trip?

20
00:01:22,180 --> 00:01:23,040
Of course.

21
00:01:25,240 --> 00:01:26,620
What's so funny?

22
00:01:27,060 --> 00:01:30,180
You can't possibly place in
the top without any training!

23
00:01:30,180 --> 00:01:31,480
You'll just embarrass yourself.

24
00:01:31,480 --> 00:01:32,900
Don't, don't do it.

25
00:01:33,340 --> 00:01:34,180
No way.

26
00:01:34,180 --> 00:01:38,440
But you always rack up the
highest scores at the arcade.

27
00:01:38,880 --> 00:01:40,000
Idiot!

28
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:41,220
Don't compare it to a game!

29
00:01:41,220 --> 00:01:45,100
Either way,
our precinct can't have the lowest scorer.

30
00:01:45,100 --> 00:01:46,420
Just go home already.

31
00:01:46,420 --> 00:01:47,960
I'm definitely participating.

32
00:01:48,360 --> 00:01:53,940
No way I'm letting you! I'm going! No way! I'm going!
I'm going! I'm going! No way! No way! No way!

33
00:01:53,940 --> 00:01:57,980
Ohara-kun, come on,
let Ryotsu-kun shoot too.

34
00:01:57,980 --> 00:02:03,880
After all, it's a good chance to show
how important daily shooting practice is.

35
00:02:03,880 --> 00:02:07,560
If you post the lowest score,
you'll answer to me.

36
00:02:07,560 --> 00:02:11,320
Don't worry, Officer Ryotsu
will head to the shooting range.

37
00:02:15,900 --> 00:02:18,060
Yes, I'm ready, go ahead anytime.

38
00:02:18,060 --> 00:02:21,460
Hey, what's that gun?
Don't you dare modify it on your own!

39
00:02:55,160 --> 00:02:55,680
Hmph.

40
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:59,480
You deliberately missed that last shot,
didn't you?

41
00:02:59,860 --> 00:03:03,080
Officer Ryotsu, accidental miss,
1 point, 99 points.

42
00:03:03,080 --> 00:03:08,160
So, the men's division winner is Officer Nakagawa,
runner-up is Officer Ryotsu.

43
00:03:08,680 --> 00:03:10,520
Well, this is a total mess, isn't it?

44
00:03:10,520 --> 00:03:14,800
Wonderful, both of you! Now we can all
go on the overseas training together.

45
00:03:14,800 --> 00:03:16,080
You deliberately missed, didn't you?

46
00:03:16,080 --> 00:03:19,420
I'm really looking forward to
going on training with you, senpai.

47
00:03:19,420 --> 00:03:20,720
You did that on purpose, didn't you, Ryotsu?

48
00:03:21,460 --> 00:03:23,280
Look at that, Ryo-chan.
I've gained a new respect for you.

49
00:03:23,480 --> 00:03:25,440
You did it on purpose, right?
Just admit you did it on purpose.

50
00:03:25,700 --> 00:03:28,180
Yes! An overseas vacation
for a cup of coffee.

51
00:03:29,580 --> 00:03:32,620
Please, just say you did it on purpose.
Come on, Ryo-chan.

52
00:03:44,560 --> 00:03:48,020
Why didn't I get first or second place?

53
00:03:48,220 --> 00:03:49,920
You got the booby prize,
so it can't be helped.

54
00:03:51,460 --> 00:03:53,000
I've never heard of a "B prize" before.

55
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:55,520
Don't be so unseemly, Honda.
It's already decided.

56
00:03:55,520 --> 00:03:57,360
I still don't want to.

57
00:03:57,360 --> 00:03:59,440
An overseas trip with you, senpai?

58
00:03:59,440 --> 00:04:01,280
After what happened the other day,
you're still pushing hard.

59
00:04:01,280 --> 00:04:02,220
Honda-kun.

60
00:04:02,220 --> 00:04:05,760
Apparently, the training destination,
Tondemo Hachibun Island,

61
00:04:05,760 --> 00:04:07,420
has blonde, busty gals

62
00:04:07,420 --> 00:04:08,960
swarming all over it, they say.

63
00:04:08,960 --> 00:04:10,520
Really?

64
00:04:10,520 --> 00:04:12,440
Let's finish this training quickly,

65
00:04:12,440 --> 00:04:15,100
and head to the dream
course of blonde busty gals.

66
00:04:15,100 --> 00:04:16,180
That's the invitation.

67
00:04:16,180 --> 00:04:17,800
No, no, but for me...

68
00:04:18,200 --> 00:04:19,360
Otohime-chan is...

69
00:04:19,360 --> 00:04:23,840
Well then, I'll just take the busty
Pasukin gal all for myself, hehe.

70
00:04:23,840 --> 00:04:28,120
Aw, that's a shame.
It's a busty Pasukin gal, after all.

71
00:04:28,120 --> 00:04:29,700
What a waste.

72
00:04:29,700 --> 00:04:33,400
Busty Pasukin, busty Pasukin, busty Pasukin!

73
00:04:33,400 --> 00:04:37,100
Senpai, I've decided,
I'm following you no matter what.

74
00:04:37,100 --> 00:04:39,320
Good. I'm counting on you, my vanguard.

75
00:04:39,320 --> 00:04:39,860
Yes.

76
00:04:39,860 --> 00:04:41,080
Lord Ryo!

77
00:04:41,080 --> 00:04:45,180
What's this "busty Pasukin" supposed to be?

78
00:04:45,180 --> 00:04:46,360
Well, that's

79
00:04:47,540 --> 00:04:48,220
Stop it!

80
00:04:48,880 --> 00:04:50,400
Fall! Come on, fall!

81
00:05:02,460 --> 00:05:03,780
Well then, shall we go?

82
00:05:04,120 --> 00:05:05,820
Where are Senpai and Honda?

83
00:05:06,020 --> 00:05:07,740
They were right here a moment ago.

84
00:05:08,120 --> 00:05:09,511
Knowing Ryo-chan,

85
00:05:09,561 --> 00:05:13,220
he's probably at the beach groping
the busty Pasukin gal's butt, right?

86
00:05:14,220 --> 00:05:14,760
Be quiet.

87
00:05:22,380 --> 00:05:25,560
Hey Honda, glad you came, right?

88
00:05:25,560 --> 00:05:26,560
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

89
00:05:26,560 --> 00:05:27,380
Alright, let's go.

90
00:05:27,380 --> 00:05:28,080
Yes.

91
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:31,060
We'll apply the oil for free.

92
00:05:31,060 --> 00:05:34,220
If you'd like, massage is an option too.

93
00:05:34,220 --> 00:05:35,360
We'll put the oil on you.

94
00:05:35,360 --> 00:05:36,780
Is it because of the massage too?

95
00:05:37,620 --> 00:05:39,080
What are you doing?

96
00:05:39,080 --> 00:05:41,700
Ryo-sama, you came for training again,
didn't you?

97
00:05:41,700 --> 00:05:43,960
Honda's going to end up
with Otohime-chan too.

98
00:05:44,220 --> 00:05:45,600
No, no, not that! Please, anything but that!

99
00:05:50,820 --> 00:05:53,140
Wow, you brought quite a lot, didn't you.

100
00:05:53,320 --> 00:05:54,340
Well, of course.

101
00:05:54,390 --> 00:05:57,600
Here, you can fire guns you can't shoot in Japan,
after all.

102
00:05:57,820 --> 00:05:59,760
Senpai and Honda, take whichever you like.

103
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:00,520
I see.

104
00:06:23,460 --> 00:06:24,480
Ryo-chan, did you hear?

105
00:06:24,740 --> 00:06:27,660
The men's instructor is
apparently an amazing person.

106
00:06:28,960 --> 00:06:29,600
An amazing person?

107
00:06:30,120 --> 00:06:35,000
Apparently, even though he's Japanese, he served in the U.S. Army's Green Berets
and fought in wars all over the world.

108
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:41,340
Then he became a top-class sniper with the New York City Police Department too,
racking up countless achievements against the mafia, they say.

109
00:06:41,900 --> 00:06:44,140
Interesting!
Let's have him put us through our paces!

110
00:06:45,340 --> 00:06:47,360
I'm going home!

111
00:06:48,040 --> 00:06:49,320
I'm here with you,
so there's nothing to be scared of!

112
00:06:55,880 --> 00:06:57,380
Why? There's nobody here!

113
00:06:58,060 --> 00:06:58,620
You're late!

114
00:07:14,840 --> 00:07:18,520
I'm the one training you for the next week,
so this is your last warning.

115
00:07:18,920 --> 00:07:20,840
From now on, don't be late.

116
00:07:36,060 --> 00:07:38,460
If you come up behind me again,

117
00:07:38,940 --> 00:07:39,740
I'll kill you.

118
00:07:44,260 --> 00:07:44,900
Not yet, not yet.

119
00:07:47,080 --> 00:07:48,440
Such a sloppy attitude...

120
00:07:56,660 --> 00:07:59,240
As expected,
the training here at the source is brutal.

121
00:07:59,240 --> 00:08:01,360
If they do any more of that,
I'll never survive.

122
00:08:01,360 --> 00:08:02,320
I want to go home.

123
00:08:02,880 --> 00:08:04,280
What are you going to do like that?

124
00:08:04,660 --> 00:08:06,640
The morning training
was just a calling card.

125
00:08:06,640 --> 00:08:08,700
The afternoon training will be even tougher.

126
00:08:08,700 --> 00:08:20,580
Uuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuugh...

127
00:08:21,580 --> 00:08:23,840
He's just looking for his wallet, right?

128
00:08:23,840 --> 00:08:26,720
In New York, reaching into your
jacket is considered drawing a gun,

129
00:08:26,720 --> 00:08:28,440
so shooting him is self-defense.

130
00:08:28,440 --> 00:08:30,040
This isn't New York.

131
00:08:30,540 --> 00:08:31,420
I-I see.

132
00:08:32,120 --> 00:08:33,040
My apologies.

133
00:08:46,140 --> 00:08:47,560
Cover me.

134
00:08:47,880 --> 00:08:50,240
You idiot, where's the enemy?

135
00:08:50,240 --> 00:08:52,100
It was this sound, that one.

136
00:08:57,900 --> 00:08:58,940
What the hell are you doing?

137
00:08:58,940 --> 00:09:03,480
Sorry, it's a habit from my Green Beret days.
My body reacts to every sound.

138
00:09:04,080 --> 00:09:05,000
Pardon me again.

139
00:09:05,820 --> 00:09:07,220
I want to go home.

140
00:09:07,800 --> 00:09:10,820
But with things this dangerous,
I can't even eat in peace.

141
00:09:10,820 --> 00:09:12,360
We'll hold on to the guns.

142
00:09:15,620 --> 00:09:16,500
Is this good enough?

143
00:09:16,500 --> 00:09:17,020
Okay.

144
00:09:21,200 --> 00:09:22,940
What's that bulge on your chest?

145
00:09:22,940 --> 00:09:24,620
U-uh, this is...

146
00:09:24,620 --> 00:09:25,460
Show me.

147
00:09:25,460 --> 00:09:27,560
What is this?

148
00:09:28,860 --> 00:09:30,660
You're not hiding anything else, are you?

149
00:09:32,400 --> 00:09:33,280
Really?

150
00:09:35,400 --> 00:09:36,280
Absolutely.

151
00:09:38,200 --> 00:09:39,600
Now it's Nakagawa's turn.

152
00:09:39,600 --> 00:09:40,900
Roll up your pant legs.

153
00:09:43,840 --> 00:09:45,460
There's a Walther PPK in the mischief.

154
00:09:45,460 --> 00:09:46,760
Over here, the Chief's...

155
00:09:46,760 --> 00:09:48,260
What do you mean?

156
00:09:48,440 --> 00:09:50,380
No, it's for emergencies.

157
00:09:51,280 --> 00:09:53,540
Stretch your right hand
out as far as you can.

158
00:09:53,540 --> 00:09:56,980
I have no idea what you mean.

159
00:09:56,980 --> 00:09:58,420
Just stretch it out, I'm telling you!

160
00:09:58,420 --> 00:09:58,880
Yes.

161
00:10:00,240 --> 00:10:01,740
So you were hiding guns after all.

162
00:10:02,380 --> 00:10:04,260
A Beretta Minx on your left arm, too?

163
00:10:04,260 --> 00:10:07,120
Strip him and search him thoroughly!

164
00:10:07,120 --> 00:10:08,100
W-wait, no way!

165
00:10:11,220 --> 00:10:12,852
Six small automatic pistols,

166
00:10:12,902 --> 00:10:15,893
four Derringers, 120 rounds of ammunition,

167
00:10:15,943 --> 00:10:17,027
three hand grenades,

168
00:10:17,077 --> 00:10:20,100
one plastic explosive, six knives.

169
00:10:20,100 --> 00:10:23,800
And you've even got a Mauser
full-auto hidden on your back?

170
00:10:23,800 --> 00:10:25,500
N-no, that's...

171
00:10:25,500 --> 00:10:27,420
Are you a walking arsenal or what?

172
00:10:27,420 --> 00:10:28,460
Sorry.

173
00:10:32,660 --> 00:10:34,100
What's this bulge?

174
00:10:34,100 --> 00:10:36,760
T-this is definitely not a Desert Eagle!

175
00:10:39,080 --> 00:10:39,880
That's enough.

176
00:10:39,880 --> 00:10:42,160
What do you mean, Desert Eagle?

177
00:10:42,160 --> 00:10:43,760
Isn't that a New Nambu?

178
00:10:43,760 --> 00:10:44,400
My apologies.

179
00:10:44,400 --> 00:10:46,920
I got a little too carried away.

180
00:10:49,640 --> 00:10:51,720
We'll hold on to these.

181
00:10:51,720 --> 00:10:52,880
N-no way...

182
00:10:52,880 --> 00:10:55,700
Good, now we can eat in peace.

183
00:10:55,700 --> 00:10:56,280
Right.

184
00:10:59,080 --> 00:11:01,120
It's just a toy gun.

185
00:11:01,120 --> 00:11:04,760
You're really a big coward, aren't you?

186
00:11:06,760 --> 00:11:10,600
Don't be ridiculous!
I'm thinking about safety on top of safety!

187
00:11:11,520 --> 00:11:12,920
An enemy snake!

188
00:11:16,980 --> 00:11:18,440
Th-there's blood from my arm!

189
00:11:19,180 --> 00:11:21,620
Even the top-notch
instructor is no match for him

190
00:11:21,620 --> 00:11:24,400
He's even more pathetic than
me when I'm not on the mic

191
00:11:28,700 --> 00:11:32,700
That's so mean, Ryo-sama! You left me
behind and went off to eat lunch without me!

192
00:11:32,700 --> 00:11:36,100
Come on, let's just eat by ourselves.

193
00:11:39,260 --> 00:11:40,400
I saw it.

194
00:11:47,780 --> 00:11:49,200
What are you doing?

195
00:11:53,100 --> 00:11:54,760
Did I go a little too far?

196
00:11:54,760 --> 00:11:56,120
Are you alright?

197
00:12:04,040 --> 00:12:05,940
What's with this weird guy?

198
00:12:07,760 --> 00:12:10,440
He's the last one... What a pathetic guy.

199
00:12:12,340 --> 00:12:20,520
I've only been around high school boys, so just having a beauty come within a meter of me...
If you'd like, please feel free to use this.

200
00:12:20,520 --> 00:12:21,840
Thanks.

201
00:12:23,920 --> 00:12:25,000
Aaaaah!

202
00:12:28,600 --> 00:12:31,980
What is this shock that pierced my body?

203
00:12:38,180 --> 00:12:39,660
Beautiful.

204
00:12:40,220 --> 00:12:41,660
A handkerchief.

205
00:12:41,660 --> 00:12:43,760
Excuse me.

206
00:12:46,240 --> 00:12:50,140
Strange, even though she's such a super beauty,
I can't get a single word out.

207
00:12:50,140 --> 00:12:54,820
Could it be that this woman and I
are bound by the red thread of fate?

208
00:12:59,240 --> 00:13:00,300
Actually,

209
00:13:00,300 --> 00:13:00,800
Yes?

210
00:13:01,800 --> 00:13:03,845
Um uh uh,

211
00:13:03,895 --> 00:13:06,440
Uh please go on a date with me.

212
00:13:07,640 --> 00:13:08,000
What?

213
00:13:08,740 --> 00:13:10,880
So I'll go back to my
room and change clothes,

214
00:13:10,880 --> 00:13:15,000
let's meet in 30 minutes at the
fountain in the park up ahead.

215
00:13:15,440 --> 00:13:16,440
B-but

216
00:13:16,440 --> 00:13:16,860
Then,

217
00:13:21,280 --> 00:13:22,220
Ryo-sama!

218
00:13:22,760 --> 00:13:25,700
I don't want to go on a
date with someone like him!

219
00:13:25,700 --> 00:13:26,980
Please do something about it!

220
00:13:28,500 --> 00:13:30,440
No, just go on a date with him, Maria.

221
00:13:32,580 --> 00:13:32,980
How could you?

222
00:13:34,560 --> 00:13:35,560
That's cruel.

223
00:13:37,180 --> 00:13:38,860
That's way too cruel.

224
00:13:40,360 --> 00:13:42,280
Ryo-chan, how could you say such a thing?

225
00:13:42,280 --> 00:13:43,420
Calm down.

226
00:13:43,420 --> 00:13:45,460
Hey, listen to what I'm saying.

227
00:13:45,460 --> 00:13:49,600
He's a weird guy who shoots his gun at anyone,
anywhere.

228
00:13:49,600 --> 00:13:52,620
I think he's less weird
and more of a lunatic.

229
00:13:53,260 --> 00:13:56,080
I think the reason that
guy's life is so messed up

230
00:13:56,080 --> 00:13:58,680
is boys' school, the army, and the NYPD.

231
00:13:58,680 --> 00:14:02,480
He's only ever lived and worked around men,
and I think that's the cause.

232
00:14:02,480 --> 00:14:04,160
That might be true.

233
00:14:04,160 --> 00:14:07,060
He's probably never once
been on a date with a woman,

234
00:14:07,060 --> 00:14:09,940
so if that guy asked someone out,

235
00:14:09,940 --> 00:14:13,160
wouldn't this be a good chance to
change him into a decent person?

236
00:14:13,160 --> 00:14:16,380
That's true, but Maria is a man.

237
00:14:16,380 --> 00:14:20,320
So, as practice before
he dates a real woman,

238
00:14:20,320 --> 00:14:24,300
I still don't want to go on a date
with any gentleman other than Ryo-san.

239
00:14:24,300 --> 00:14:26,720
So you're fine with me
getting killed by Maria?

240
00:14:28,680 --> 00:14:31,560
We have to train for a whole week with that walking armory,
you know.

241
00:14:31,560 --> 00:14:33,760
It's no surprise if he shoots one
of us with a pistol at any moment.

242
00:14:34,100 --> 00:14:34,880
That's why, Maria.

243
00:14:34,880 --> 00:14:37,080
If you hook him good right here,

244
00:14:37,080 --> 00:14:38,480
we'll all be saved.

245
00:14:38,840 --> 00:14:40,100
Understand, Maria?

246
00:14:41,340 --> 00:14:41,980
Understood.

247
00:14:41,980 --> 00:14:44,620
I'll go on a date for Ryo-sama's sake.

248
00:14:45,060 --> 00:14:46,740
Don't worry, Maria-chan.

249
00:14:46,740 --> 00:14:48,960
We'll sneak along and keep an eye on you.

250
00:14:48,960 --> 00:14:50,120
Right, Ryo-chan?

251
00:14:50,120 --> 00:14:52,520
Are you coming along too, Ryo-sama?

252
00:14:54,000 --> 00:14:54,640
Yeah, I suppose.

253
00:14:54,640 --> 00:14:56,460
Just as I expected, Ryo-sama!

254
00:14:56,460 --> 00:14:57,220
I'm so happy!

255
00:15:13,820 --> 00:15:14,680
It hurts, you know.

256
00:15:15,160 --> 00:15:16,760
They're right on time.

257
00:15:16,760 --> 00:15:19,120
At least he's not carrying a rifle.

258
00:15:19,120 --> 00:15:20,120
Take a good look.

259
00:15:20,880 --> 00:15:23,140
He's got a pistol firmly in his right hand.

260
00:15:24,580 --> 00:15:26,000
Another one under his left arm.

261
00:15:26,000 --> 00:15:29,240
A small revolver on each side of his waist.

262
00:15:29,800 --> 00:15:31,600
And the bulges in his pockets are,
