263
00:15:31,600 --> 00:15:32,760
He really is.

264
00:15:33,540 --> 00:15:36,440
We just confiscated them,
and he's still carrying more.

265
00:15:36,440 --> 00:15:38,060
Honestly, what a coward.

266
00:15:38,560 --> 00:15:40,960
His footing is set so he can
go into combat at any moment.

267
00:15:40,960 --> 00:15:41,940
And look at how his eyes scan around.

268
00:15:41,940 --> 00:15:44,180
He's like a bodyguard on high alert.

269
00:15:44,540 --> 00:15:46,820
