295
00:17:09,840 --> 00:17:12,780
It's because I was once shot
at from a car by the mafia,

296
00:17:12,780 --> 00:17:14,820
so whenever a suspicious car gets close,
I just...

297
00:17:15,660 --> 00:17:17,640
