298
00:17:17,640 --> 00:17:18,200
Sorry.

299
00:17:18,720 --> 00:17:20,460
Great instincts, Volvo-san.

300
00:17:20,460 --> 00:17:23,520
That bouquet had a shotgun hidden in it,
didn't it?

301
00:17:23,520 --> 00:17:25,360
We can't get close without standing out.

302
00:17:36,100 --> 00:17:41,580
It's an M60 tank. I mean reactive armor,
explosive reactive armor.

303
00:17:42,220 --> 00:17:48,860
In other words, even if it's hit by an anti-tank missile, the recoil of the explosion reduces the damage.
That's the latest technology.

304
00:17:49,280 --> 00:17:57,300
Get it? I thought you were going on a date somewhere,
but a gangster movie and war movie double feature

305
00:17:57,300 --> 00:17:58,880
Poor Maria-chan.

306
00:17:59,300 --> 00:17:59,620
Me.

307
00:18:10,000 --> 00:18:12,580
He's been checking out the
weapons for three hours already.

308
00:18:12,580 --> 00:18:14,300
Poor Maria.

309
00:18:17,440 --> 00:18:18,460
Go out with me.

310
00:18:18,460 --> 00:18:21,920
No, it should be
"go out with me, with marriage in mind."

311
00:18:21,920 --> 00:18:22,400
What?

312
00:18:23,580 --> 00:18:25,320
No, it's nothing.

313
00:18:28,460 --> 00:18:31,220
Now they've gone into a sports gym.

314
00:18:32,380 --> 00:18:33,920
What kind of date course is this?

315
00:18:33,920 --> 00:18:35,500
That's unusual.

316
00:18:36,100 --> 00:18:37,260
Poor Maria.

317
00:18:37,260 --> 00:18:38,780
Alright, let's go in too.

318
00:18:41,160 --> 00:18:41,540
15

319
