I come to this gym every day.

320
00:18:46,340 --> 00:18:47,900
So you're working on your body.

321
00:18:48,460 --> 00:18:49,400
That, that's...

322
00:18:49,400 --> 00:18:50,700
A punching ball?

323
00:18:51,920 --> 00:18:53,260
Let me try it.

324
00:18:53,260 --> 00:18:56,120
It's dangerous,
so please stand back a little.

325
00:18:56,120 --> 00:18:56,480
Yes.

326
00:19:04,300 --> 00:19:05,800
Wow! Something just snapped!

327
00:19:06,180 --> 00:19:09,720
Hahaha! I thought I was holding
back a little on that one, though.

328
00:19:10,880 --> 00:19:12,920
That bastard, getting carried away.

329
00:19:13,860 --> 00:19:14,580
Hey, Maria!

330
00:19:15,120 --> 00:19:15,440
Yes?

331
00:19:15,660 --> 00:19:16,680
You try it too!

332
00:19:16,840 --> 00:19:17,920
A-are you sure?

333
00:19:18,100 --> 00:19:19,300
Yeah, go all out!

334
00:19:19,620 --> 00:19:22,240
Yes! I think I'll give it a try too!

335
00:19:23,020 --> 00:19:23,660
Are you alright?

336
00:19:23,880 --> 00:19:24,160
Yes!

337
00:19:34,360 --> 00:19:36,020
I'm sorry.

338
00:19:36,020 --> 00:19:37,900
W-wow, what a punch!

339
00:19:38,460 --> 00:19:41,000
I used to do a bit of kickboxing,
so

340
