344
00:19:49,560 --> 00:19:50,820
N-nothing at all.

345
00:19:51,600 --> 00:19:53,220
Right, there's a pool in the back.

346
00:19:53,220 --> 00:19:55,260
It's spacious,
and the atmosphere is fantastic.

347
00:19:55,260 --> 00:19:56,560
But what about swimsuits?

348
00:19:57,000 --> 00:19:58,000
They have rentals, so don't worry.

349
00:19:58,500 --> 00:19:59,580
Come on, let's go!

350
00:20:05,580 --> 00:20:10,900
1, 2, 3, 4, 2, 2, 3, 4

351
00:20:11,640 --> 00:20:15,780
Maria-san, with marriage in mind,
