352
00:20:15,780 --> 00:20:17,360
No, actually, never mind, I'll just...

353
00:20:17,360 --> 00:20:18,260
Sorry to keep you waiting.

354
00:20:25,640 --> 00:20:26,520
Beautiful.

355
00:20:27,560 --> 00:20:29,500
Since I've been stuck
in an all-male workplace,

356
00:20:29,500 --> 00:20:31,940
I had no idea women could be this beautiful!

357
00:20:31,940 --> 00:20:39,460
What's that? This one?
This is the P11 by Heckler & Koch.

358
00:20:39,840 --> 00:20:46,800
It's a pistol that can fire underwater. At pools and baths,
places where people don't carry weapons get targeted, so you need this.

359
00:20:46,800 --> 00:20:52,640
It comes from my experience doing protection duty.
That's why I keep my holster on even in the bath.

360
00:20:53,060 --> 00:20:55,820
What a creepy school.
It's almost all perverts.

361
00:20:56,660 --> 00:20:58,080
It really is open!

362
00:20:58,620 --> 00:20:59,760
Maria-san,

363
00:21:04,380 --> 00:21:05,960
Nice weather, isn't it?

364
00:21:07,280 --> 00:21:08,480
