for everyone around him.

367
00:21:24,640 --> 00:21:26,360
Idiot! A bomb! What happened?!

368
00:21:26,360 --> 00:21:27,120
Full cover!

369
00:21:32,040 --> 00:21:34,060
He's turning the whole
place into a battlefield!

370
00:21:34,260 --> 00:21:36,320
That's what happens when
you swim in that get-up!

371
00:21:36,520 --> 00:21:38,340
Maria! Enemy! Take cover!

372
00:21:39,040 --> 00:21:41,460
Wasn't that explosion Golgo's?

373
00:21:43,100 --> 00:21:44,000
It really was!

374
00:21:44,460 --> 00:21:45,700
Everyone, you're all sentenced to death!

375
00:21:45,820 --> 00:21:48,040
Oops, I accidentally
pulled the pin on a grenade!

376
00:21:48,300 --> 00:21:50,580
"Accidentally"my foot,
that idiot did it on purpose!

377
00:21:51,260 --> 00:21:53,260
After all, he's a walking arsenal.

378
00:21:56,220 --> 00:21:58,040
He's going up to the diving platform,
isn't he?

379
00:21:58,860 --> 00:22:01,100
Damn, we can't follow
him all the way up there.

380
00:22:01,100 --> 00:22:02,260
Maria-chan!

381
00:22:02,260 --> 00:22:05,080
