382
00:22:05,080 --> 00:22:07,600
Since we're here,
let's go all the way to the top.

383
00:22:09,680 --> 00:22:11,060
It's so high!

384
00:22:12,200 --> 00:22:13,180
Maria-san.

385
00:22:13,740 --> 00:22:14,100
Yes?

386
00:22:14,100 --> 00:22:16,120
Actually, well

387
00:22:21,880 --> 00:22:24,160
Things look like they're getting really bad!

388
00:22:25,640 --> 00:22:26,660
What should I do?

389
00:22:26,940 --> 00:22:29,800
There's no choice!
Just tell them you're a man!

390
00:22:30,180 --> 00:22:33,120
Understood!
I actually have something to tell you!

391
00:22:33,500 --> 00:22:34,183
W-wait -

392
00:22:34,233 --> 00:22:37,900
Could it be that Maria is
confessing her love to me?

393
00:22:38,320 --> 00:22:40,880
Actually, I'm a man!

394
00:22:41,460 --> 00:22:45,980
Is this a joke? Come on, not now!

395
00:22:45,980 --> 00:22:48,620
Anyway, Maria, you and I...

396
00:22:49,040 --> 00:22:53,020
Ryo-san isn't believing me at all!
What should I do?

397
00:22:53,020 --> 00:22:55,500
No choice!
Show them proof that you're a man!

398
00:22:55,740 --> 00:22:56,460
Proof?

399
00:22:56,860 --> 00:22:59,620
That's right!
Show them that thing only men have, Maria!

400
00:23:00,420 --> 00:23:03,040
I can't do such an indecent thing!

401
00:23:03,480 --> 00:23:05,100
Do you not care what happens to you, Maria?

402
00:23:05,800 --> 00:23:06,780
No...

403
00:23:06,780 --> 00:23:08,140
Do it, Maria!

404
00:23:10,980 --> 00:23:13,560
Open your eyes wide and look properly!

405
00:23:18,880 --> 00:23:21,980
Maria, you're...

406
00:23:33,800 --> 00:23:35,620
Wh-what kind of...

407
00:23:35,620 --> 00:23:37,540
What kind of...

408
00:23:46,100 --> 00:23:49,040
One more meter to the side
and it would've been the pool.

409
00:23:49,040 --> 00:23:50,800
He's a hopeless case, isn't he.

410
00:23:52,140 --> 00:23:53,280
No way, that's ridiculous.

411
00:23:54,500 --> 00:23:55,980
A horizontal line formation, no less.

412
00:24:00,640 --> 00:24:04,480
I really did wrong by Mr. Volvo yesterday.

413
00:24:04,920 --> 00:24:06,480
Don't worry about it.

414
00:24:06,480 --> 00:24:10,000
Thanks to that, we won't have to be
trained by that armed drill instructor.

415
00:24:10,980 --> 00:24:14,360
If you hang around this guy,
you'll die a hundred times over.

416
00:24:14,360 --> 00:24:15,220
No kidding.

417
00:24:15,220 --> 00:24:16,320
Get mall

418
00:24:17,720 --> 00:24:20,320
I was rude yesterday.

419
00:24:20,320 --> 00:24:23,180
Why are you here?

420
00:24:23,180 --> 00:24:25,240
Weren't you supposed to be in the hospital?

421
00:24:25,240 --> 00:24:28,560
Hospitalized over a scratch like this?

422
00:24:28,560 --> 00:24:30,620
After falling from such a high place...

423
00:24:31,100 --> 00:24:32,120
I'm well trained.

424
00:24:32,120 --> 00:24:33,620
Not human.

425
00:24:33,620 --> 00:24:36,740
I'm sorry about yesterday.

426
00:24:37,400 --> 00:24:38,860
Don't worry about it.

427
00:24:39,280 --> 00:24:40,760
I thought it was strange too.

428
00:24:41,120 --> 00:24:42,980
Even though she's this beautiful,
I didn't get a nosebleed.

429
00:24:42,980 --> 00:24:45,220
More importantly,
now that we know Maria is a man,

430
00:24:45,220 --> 00:24:48,540
