Ryotsu and the others too.

431
00:24:48,540 --> 00:24:51,620
No, thank you, I'll decline.

432
00:24:51,620 --> 00:24:52,780
Don't be shy.

433
00:24:52,780 --> 00:24:56,780
With punching power like that, if you train,
you could easily hold your own even with the Green Berets.

434
00:25:02,040 --> 00:25:03,100
What is it, Jonker?

435
00:25:03,680 --> 00:25:06,160
Didn't I tell you not to get near my back?

436
00:25:07,100 --> 00:25:10,360
Sorry, an airmail letter from America arrived,
and I forgot about it.

437
00:25:10,740 --> 00:25:11,540
America.

438
00:25:12,940 --> 00:25:13,260
This is...

439
00:25:15,580 --> 00:25:18,280
What's wrong? Her face suddenly turned pale.

440
00:25:18,280 --> 00:25:20,000
It's a cursed letter!

441
00:25:20,760 --> 00:25:21,660
It's worse than that.

442
00:25:25,460 --> 00:25:28,380
Colonel Bakuryu is coming,
and today, no less.

443
00:25:28,380 --> 00:25:30,640
Colonel Bakuryu? Who's that?

444
00:25:30,640 --> 00:25:32,500
He was our superior officer
back in the Green Beret days.

445
00:25:32,500 --> 00:25:35,640
A hardened soldier who
survived countless battlefields.

446
00:25:36,160 --> 00:25:39,402
Ha ha now that'd be quite a sight.
Since he's Volvo's superior officer,

447
00:25:39,452 --> 00:25:41,560
he might turn out to be a total pervert

448
00:25:41,680 --> 00:25:42,580
Y-yeah, that's right.

449
00:25:43,880 --> 00:25:48,220
