the strongest in the world.

454
00:26:00,440 --> 00:26:02,740
G-good luck, stay safe!

455
00:26:02,880 --> 00:26:04,100
We can't back down like this!

456
00:26:04,700 --> 00:26:05,960
Everyone, don't let go of each other!

457
00:26:06,100 --> 00:26:07,520
Everyone, hold on to each other's waists!

458
00:26:09,220 --> 00:26:11,540
Aren't those bulletproof vests?

459
00:26:12,080 --> 00:26:13,680
You two should change too.

460
00:26:13,940 --> 00:26:15,960
Isn't that a bit much, no matter what?

461
00:26:16,520 --> 00:26:19,720
You say that because you don't
know how terrifying the colonel is.

462
00:26:20,300 --> 00:26:22,940
That man shoots people as a greeting,
after all.

463
00:26:23,420 --> 00:26:25,060
Don't blame me if a stray bullet hits you.

464
00:26:25,380 --> 00:26:26,280
Don't scare us like that!

465
00:26:26,660 --> 00:26:28,940
Anyway,
maybe we should do as he says and change.

466
00:26:29,300 --> 00:26:30,400
Like Honda did.

467
00:26:31,820 --> 00:26:32,940
He's fast.

468
00:26:34,100 --> 00:26:35,740
I want to go home.

469
00:26:49,520 --> 00:26:52,000
Bringing out rocket launchers
and even a Vulcan cannon,

470
00:26:52,000 --> 00:26:53,640
