471
00:26:54,020 --> 00:26:55,240
Even this isn't enough.

472
00:26:55,240 --> 00:26:56,920
We could use tanks too.

473
00:26:56,920 --> 00:26:59,680
This music is...

474
00:26:59,680 --> 00:27:01,640
Wagner's "Ride of the Valkyries," isn't it?

475
00:27:01,640 --> 00:27:04,100
Why's it coming from outside?

476
00:27:04,100 --> 00:27:06,020
The colonel must've arrived.

477
00:27:06,460 --> 00:27:07,340
That's a helicopter sound.

478
00:27:07,340 --> 00:27:08,120
Just as I thought.

479
00:27:10,600 --> 00:27:12,280
Isn't it a media helicopter?

480
00:27:15,280 --> 00:27:15,800
That's...

481
00:27:16,560 --> 00:27:18,000
