482
00:27:30,560 --> 00:27:32,940
Why would an American military
aircraft be way out here?

483
00:27:32,940 --> 00:27:34,480
It's coming this way!

484
00:27:37,020 --> 00:27:38,420
Everyone, get against the wall!

485
00:27:51,800 --> 00:27:53,620
