486
00:27:53,780 --> 00:27:54,800
I told you so!

487
00:27:54,920 --> 00:27:55,900
Damn it, what a joke!

488
00:27:56,100 --> 00:27:56,760
Give it here!

489
00:27:56,780 --> 00:27:57,060
Stop it!

490
00:28:00,520 --> 00:28:04,340
So you missed!

491
00:28:04,460 --> 00:28:05,840
What have you done?!

492
00:28:07,020 --> 00:28:09,160
It'll come back ten times,
no, a hundred times worse!

493
00:28:39,380 --> 00:28:41,680
This happened because
you used a rocket launcher!

494
00:28:42,240 --> 00:28:44,800
What are you talking about?
You're the one who brought that thing!

495
00:28:45,340 --> 00:28:48,200
That was for self-defense, not an attack!

496
00:28:50,260 --> 00:28:52,160
He's coming down.

497
00:29:19,920 --> 00:29:20,960
Volbo... this is the end!

498
00:29:20,960 --> 00:29:22,260
Long time no see.

499
00:29:22,260 --> 00:29:23,740
So this is the colonel?

500
00:29:26,360 --> 00:29:27,520
It's been a long time, sir.

501
00:29:27,520 --> 00:29:28,120
Colonel.

502
00:29:28,120 --> 00:29:28,540
Yeah.

503
00:29:28,540 --> 00:29:30,100
That uniform suits you.

504
00:29:30,100 --> 00:29:31,280
