507
00:29:38,560 --> 00:29:39,740
It really went up.

508
00:29:39,740 --> 00:29:41,080
He's a terrifying man.

509
00:29:43,100 --> 00:29:44,600
Your movements are so-so.

510
00:29:44,980 --> 00:29:47,640
But at this level,
you'll never be a proper soldier.

511
00:29:47,640 --> 00:29:48,980
We're not soldiers.

512
00:29:49,400 --> 00:29:51,700
Well, well,
you intend to defy your superior?

513
00:29:51,700 --> 00:29:53,780
I don't recall ever
having you as a superior.

514
00:29:53,780 --> 00:29:54,720
Shut up!

515
00:29:58,300 --> 00:29:59,860
I won't tolerate any back talk.

516
00:29:59,860 --> 00:30:00,960
Honestly, what a nuisance.

517
00:30:00,960 --> 00:30:04,440
You destroyed the training ground, for one thing.
That's going too far!

518
00:30:05,000 --> 00:30:07,680
Any sparks that fall on you,
