781
00:46:27,620 --> 00:46:28,660
Well then, farewell.

782
00:46:29,520 --> 00:46:30,240
See ya.

783
00:46:30,960 --> 00:46:33,280
So in the end,
all that effort was for nothing.

784
00:46:33,280 --> 00:46:37,220
But senpai,
how are we supposed to get back from here?

785
00:46:37,780 --> 00:46:41,160
Hey! You're planning to leave us behind!

786
00:46:41,520 --> 00:46:42,700
Take us home!

787
00:46:43,320 --> 00:46:45,600
We'll do a Groom Selection Part 2 someday.

788
00:46:46,380 --> 00:46:49,700
If you manage to survive out here,
I'll let you join again.

789
00:46:49,700 --> 00:46:50,860
Yes, we'll be waiting.

790
00:46:51,760 --> 00:46:53,660
Well then, I wish you all luck.

791
00:46:53,660 --> 00:46:56,280
Hey, hey, wait! Wait! Waaait!

792
00:46:59,940 --> 00:47:03,420
Ugh, I hate these Groom Selections!

